      "source_change": [
        "Added the Language / Button icons / HUD style rows of Options > Graphics: 25 private methods (k33Texts, k33Style*, k33OnStyleOpen/Close/Change), 13 private static constants and 11 private instance fields.",
        "onInit: the text assignments moved into the new k33Texts (so a finished language switch can set them again); the Max FPS row layout statements that followed them are unchanged and stay in onInit, which now calls k33Texts first. The Aspect Ratio label is set once to \"@K33UI_MAX_FPS\" instead of first to ASPECT_RATIO and then to the key.",
